toric":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","commander":"legal","brawl":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/2/4/24babb9e-edc8-484b-9db4-18abbafdf096.jpg?1562902764","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/2/4/24babb9e-edc8-484b-9db4-18abbafdf096.jpg?1562902764","power":"2","toughness":"1","isLegendary":false,"canBeCommander":false,"tags":["creature"],"printedNames":["Mímico do Ataque Costeiro"]},{"id":"42efae65-8a2e-4771-aa19-7b6ddb1cbd1d","oracleId":"7d25d3ba-7bb1-46ba-85c5-48e2966c5e61","lang":"en","name":"Mimic Match // Mimic Match (cont'd)","manaValue":0,"typeLine":"Card","oracleText":"2-4 players | 2+ packs | 10 minutes\nOBJECTIVE: Match and collect the most treasure chests before someone uncovers the mimics hiding amongst the loot!\nGET READY: Open one booster per player and remove any lands and cards without _Magic_ card backs, and then shuffle them together. Then put *two lands* back into the deck (to represent the mimics) and shuffle. Deal 16 cards face down in a *4x4 grid*. Randomly determine who goes first.\nLET'S PLAY:\nOn your turn, secretly look at *two cards* from the grid. If they share a *color* or *mana value*, you may reveal them, announce what matches and take those cards, then take another turn.\nOtherwise, leave them in place, and the next player takes their turn.\nNOTE: Colorless cards can be matched with other colorless cards, but mimics can only be matched with each other.\nAfter a match has been made, replace the empty spaces with two new cards from the deck, face down.\nThe game ends when a player reveals the two mimics, uncovering them!\nTO WIN:\nAt the end of the game, each player scores 1 point for every card they collected. The player who uncovered the mimics by matching the two lands scores an additional 2 points. If there is a tie, the player who uncovered the mimics decides who wins!","cardTypes":[],"colors":[],"colorIdentity":[],"keywords":[],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","modern":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","commander":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","legacy":"not_legal","vintage":"not_legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/4/2/42efae65-8a2e-4771-aa19-7b6ddb1cbd1d.jpg?1630032417","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/4/2/42efae65-8a2e-4771-aa19-7b6ddb1cbd1d.jpg?1630032417","power":null,"toughness":null,"isLegendary":false,"canBeCommander":false,"tags":[],"printedNames":["Mimic Match","Mimic Match (cont'd)"]},{"id":"4480fb1d-9883-47a6-8577-ea88cf9cad1e","oracleId":"936cab87-bb52-4b7f-b19c-cef7cfac959d","lang":"en","name":"Mimic // Mimic","manaValue":0,"typeLine":"Card // Card","oracleText":"","cardTypes":[],"colors":[],"colorIdentity":[],"keywords":[],"legalities":{"standard":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","modern":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","commander":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","legacy":"not_legal","vintage":"not_legal"},"imageUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/4/4/4480fb1d-9883-47a6-8577-ea88cf9cad1e.jpg?1678924132","thumbnailUrl":"https://cards.scryfall.io/small/front/4/4/4480fb1d-9883-47a6-8577-ea88cf9cad1e.jpg?1678924132","power":null,"toughness":null,"isLegendary":false,"canBeCommander":false,"tags":[],"printedNames":["Mimic"]}]}